# --- build and run output (rebuilt by npm run build / dmg / setup / tests) ---
# npm run build / dmg: dist/ (Tulai.app, .dmg, .blockmap, latest-mac.yml)
# build/compile-helpers.js -> build/bin/ (tulay-listen, tulay-ocr, tulai-pdf-text)
# build/bundle-engines.js  -> build/bin/ (llama-server, whisper, lib/*.so|*.dylib) and build/models/
# These are listed above too; the build sources in build/*.js, native/*.swift and the icons stay committed.
dist/
build/bin/
build/models/
*.dmg
*.blockmap
latest-mac.yml
*.dylib
*.so
# Python caches from the training scripts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# saved acceptance-test results (npm run test:acceptance)
.acc/
# your editor choice, written on first run
local-prefs.json
